    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i've had migraines for years and i've never had this exact feeling before. it's not like im paralyzed or anything, just a bit weird. i usually just take a couple of extra sumatriptan and some ibuprofen and sleep it off. do you think it's really worth the wait in the er just for a weird aura? im pretty sure it's just a bad one.",
